00:00:02.536 --> 00:00:06.473 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Des millions de voix s'élèvent

00:00:04.772 --> 00:00:07.708 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Alors que le mot-clic

00:00:05.806 --> 00:00:08.909 size:53% position:73% line:53%
